Are you sure it was poisonous, or was there something else wrong with
it? Read the screen carefully, especially when you die. It's dying that
teaches you the most important lessons in nethack. (That's why the save
function works the way it does.)

Another good way to learn about food is to watch your pet carefully.
Watch what it eats and when, and more importantly what it DOESN'T eat
and when. Then ask yourself why.

Also, work out strategies to keep your pet from eating all the good
corpses before you can get to them.



